WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
How much balance do I have in my account?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.700
Let me look that up for you right away. You have two

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.400
accounts. The first is a savings account,

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.930
called my savings account, with a current balance of 40

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.560
euros. The second is a regular bank account,

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:24.040
simply called bank account, with a balance of 111 euros and

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.960
50 cents. Both are in euros.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.700
Schedule a payment draft of 100 euros to my savings account

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.880
from my bank accounts,

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.160
with the description "Happy Birthday".

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.530
Let me first look up your accounts to find both your main

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:47.680
bank account and your savings account.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.210
I found your accounts. You have one bank account and one

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.200
savings account. I'll now create the

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:53.200
draft payment of 100 euros from your bank account to your

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:59.040
savings account. The draft payment has

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:04.170
been created successfully. It is for 100 euros from your

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.160
bank account to your savings account,

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.330
with the description "Happy Birthday". It is currently

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.320
pending and no money has moved yet.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:16.260
Please open your BUNQ app and confirm the draft there

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.240
before the payment will actually be sent.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:22.240
What are the pending payments in my bank accounts?

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:34.080
Let me look at your accounts first, then check for pending

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.160
draft payments. Now let me check the

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.750
draft payments on both accounts at the same time. You have

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.760
two pending draft payments across your

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.110
accounts. Here they are. First, on your savings account,

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:49.280
there is a payment of 20 euros to Timothy,

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:52.810
with the description "Transfer to Bank Account". This one

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:55.760
is still waiting for your confirmation.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.710
Second, on your bank account, there is a payment of 100

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.800
euros to Timothy,

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.620
with the description "Happy Birthday". This one is also

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.760
pending. Both of these need to be confirmed

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.390
in your BUNQ app before any money moves. Would you like to

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:13.680
do anything with either of them?

